
.subckt astra_061_mos_bootstrapped_track_switch vdd VSS sampleb vin g sample out
CB t b 10p
CL out VSS 5p
M1 vin g out VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M2 g sampleb VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M3 vdd sampleb t VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M4 b sampleb VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M5 t sampleb g t APMOS l=1u w=20u
M6 vin sampleb b vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M7 vin sample b VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
RL out VSS 1G
.ends astra_061_mos_bootstrapped_track_switch
